@Api = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Register Alice
POST {{Api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "Password123", "displayName": "Alice" }

### 2. Register Bob
POST {{Api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bob@example.com", "password": "Password123", "displayName": "Bob" }

### 3. Login as Alice (copy the token into @Token below)
POST {{Api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

###
@Token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### 4. Create a group with Bob
POST {{Api}}/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Trip to Lviv", "memberEmails": ["bob@example.com"] }

### 5. My groups
GET {{Api}}/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 6. Group details (members and their ids)
GET {{Api}}/api/groups/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 7. Add an equal-split expense (PaidByUserId = Alice's id from step 6)
POST {{Api}}/api/groups/1/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Hotel", "amount": 100.00, "paidByUserId": "PASTE_ALICE_ID", "splitType": "Equal" }

### 8. Balances
GET {{Api}}/api/groups/1/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 9. Settle up (Bob pays Alice - log in as Bob first and use his token)
POST {{Api}}/api/groups/1/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "toUserId": "PASTE_ALICE_ID", "amount": 50.00 }
